{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36447","headline":"闻杜鹃 · 罗邺","name":"闻杜鹃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花时一宿碧山前，明月东风呌杜鹃。\n孤馆觉来听夜半，羸僮相对亦无眠。\n汝身哀怨犹如此，我泪纵横岂偶然。\n争得苍苍知有恨，汝身成鹤我成仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}